2 CONT was taken in Aremark Parish. He was listed as Joen Mondsen. For details
2 CONT of Joen's life see the book "Gamle Slekter i Marker" by Martha Østensvig,
2 CONT published in 1935 and reprinted in 1996 at Sarpsborg and updated. He
2 CONT inherited the estate of Mari Schiolersdatter and her husband Thue Pedersen
2 CONT Aarnæs, as he was brought up by them after his mother died.
