2 CONT
2 CONT Selveier gårdbruker på garden Grødtvet nordre 79b i Askim. De fikk 9 barn
2 CONT
2 CONT Se folketelling  under fanen:  '''Bilder m.m.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 2 Mar 1819, Grøtvedt Nordre, Askim, Østfold, Norway Christened: 14 Mar 1819, Askim, Østfold, Norway Marriage: Sissel Andersdatter in 1839 Died: 9 Apr 1901, Grøtvedt, Askim, Østfold, Norway aged 82 Buried: 19 Apr 1901
2 CONT    Another name for Johan was Johan Gundersen Grøttvet.
2 CONT
2 CONT   General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan lived on the Fusk farm when he took over the nordre Grøttvet, bnr. 1, farm in Askim for 1600 spdl. in 1853 after his father. He farmed it until about 1890.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Research Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT In the census for 1900 he was widowed and living with his daughter Julie's family on the Grøtvedt nordre farm in Askim. He was living on a pension and helping with the farm work. 6
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan married Sissel Andersdatter, daughter of Anders Smedsen and Tore Johannesdatter, in 1839. (Sissel Andersdatter was born on 14 Mar 1817 in Gjellestad plads, Askim, Østfold, Norway, christened on 23 Mar 1817 in Askim, Østfold,
2 CONC  Norway and died before 1900 6.)
2 CONT
2 CONT   Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1865 they owned and farmed the Grøttvet nordre (79b) farm in Askim. All their children were unmarried and living with them except Gustav who was a servant for Johan Olsen on Eeg vestre. 7
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: Ken Nygaard, http://nygaard.howards.net/files/5/11031.htm#6
