1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://sv.findagrave.com/memorial/156026068/grover-cleveland-rasch
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: records found for Grover Rasch, show he was married at least 4 times: 1) Irene Ballard; 2) Ethel L.; 3) Marie Louise Clark; 4) Juanita J.
2 CONT
2 CONT Excerpts from the Oregon Death Index and the Social Security Death Index.
2 CONT Grover C. Rasch died 17 March 1968 in Multnomah County, Oregon. He was born 28 November 1885.
2 CONT Spouse: Juanita.
2 CONT Certificate: 4144.
2 CONT SSN issued: Oregon (1952).
2 CONT
2 CONT Excerpts from the Funeral Notice and the Obituary on page 24, in The Oregonian, Portland, Oregon, March 18, 1968.
2 CONT Obituary
2 CONT GROVER C. RASCH
2 CONT Died Sunday in a Portland hospital, at age 82.
2 CONT Residence: SE Rover Rd, Milwaukie, Oregon.
2 CONT Born in November, 1885.
2 CONT Civil engineer, for City of Portland, retired in 1949.
2 CONT Lived in Curry County, 1950-1962, and then returned to Portland.
2 CONT Survivors include his wife, Juanita; a daughter, Lois Jean (Mrs. Clayton) Gehman of Sumner, Md.; a son, G. Clark Rasch of Portland; 5 grandchildren.
2 CONT Private services: Cochran's Sunset Chapel, of Gladstone, in charge of arrangements.
2 CONT Interment: Lincoln Memorial Park.
2 CONT
2 CONT U.S., World War I Draft Registration Cards, 1917-1918.
2 CONT Name: Grover C. Rasch
2 CONT Residence: 188 E. 20th, Portland, Multnomah County, Oregon.
2 CONT Birth Date: 28 November 1885.
2 CONT Age: 32.
2 CONT Occupation: Engineers Clerk, City Water Bureau, Portland. Multnomah County, Oregon
2 CONT Nearest Relative: Ethel Rasch (wife), same address.
2 CONT Signature: Grover C. Rasch.
2 CONT Date: September 12, 1918.
2 CONT
2 CONT Oregon, Select Births and Christenings, 1868-1929.
2 CONT Name: Grover Cleveland Rasch.
2 CONT Gender: Male.
2 CONT Birth Date: 28 November 1885.
2 CONT Birth Place: Portland, Multnomah, Oregon.
2 CONT Father: Alfred C. M. Rasch.
2 CONT Mother: Ingeborg Hallingby.
2 CONT
2 CONT U.S., World War II Draft Registration Cards, 1942.
2 CONT Name: Grover C. Rasch.
2 CONT Residence: 1109 SE 52nd, Portland, Multnomah County, Oregon.
2 CONT Age: 56.
2 CONT Birth Date: 28 November 1885.
2 CONT Birth Place: Portland, Oregon.
2 CONT Person always knowing your addr.: Marie-Louise Rasch, same address.
2 CONT Employer: City of Portland, Water Engineering.
2 CONT Signature: Grover C. Rasch.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1910 census for Portland Ward 8, Multnomah County, Oregon, listed Grover C. Rasch as nephew, age 20, single, born in Washington. He worked as a motorman for the City Water Works. He was in the home of Elmer E. & Mabelle Lawren
2 CONC ce.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1920, Grover C. Rasch still lived in Portland. He was age 34, born in Oregon, with a wife named Ethel L. Rasch, age 26, and they had a daughter listed as 9 year old Gean. Also in the home was his mother, Ingborge Rasch, age 68,
2 CONC  born in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1930 census, Portland, Multnomah County, Oregon, Grovr C. Rasch was age 44, born in Oregon, a draftsman for the Water Bureau. His wife was listed as Marie L. Rasch age 31, and they had 2 children, Lois J. Rasch, age 19, and Gr
2 CONC over C. Rasch, not yet a year old.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Social Security Applications and Claims Index for Grover Clark Rasch, born 9 June 1929, in Portland, listed his parents as father, Grover C. Rasch, and mother, Marie L. Clark.
2 CONT - - - - - - -
2 CONT
2 CONT The obituary for Mrs. Irene (Ballard) Rasch, in 1916, said she was survived by her husband, Grover C. Rasch, and a 5 year old daughter, Lois Jean. The Multnomah County Marriage Records Index shows Grover C. Rasch and Irene Ballard
2 CONC  were married in 1907. [Multnomah County Marriages, Book 21, page 195. Marriage books located at the Genealogical Forum of Oregon, Portland, Oregon.]
2 CONT
2 CONT Oregon Marriage Indexes, 1906-1924, 1946-2008.
2 CONT This index, in Ancestry, shows only a record for a
2 CONT Grover C. Rasch, married 18 May 1917 in Multnomah County. The name of the bride was not included. The 1920 census shows Grover's wife as Ethel L.
2 CONT
