1 NOTE Thor and his brother Svend sold the Jovald farm in
2 CONT about 1872 to Sigvart Jorgensen Trandemsetra of Rømskog. Sigvart died in 1873
2 CONT of TB and his brother Andreas came to Jovald in 1873. Andreas is the great
2 CONT great grandfather of Jorn Ola Krog of Krog farm. His mother was the great
1 NOTE granddaughter of Andreas. This family was not related to Snesruds who came
2 CONT to America. In 1994 the Jovall farm was owned by Andreas and Henny (a
2 CONT Sonstegard from Sambøl) Joval. Henny's husband Andreas is the son of
2 CONT Thorvald Joval who was born in 1875. Thorvald's father was the previous
2 CONT Andreas Joval. The house of Henny and Andreas was constructed in 1865.
