1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Inger Maria emigrerer sammen med sønnen Andreas den 6. november 1869 fra Øymark til Amerika::    https://urn.digitalarkivet.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20060919050282.jpg
1 FAMC @F6000000022462262163@
1 RFN geni:6000000180367310848
1 SUBM @S6000000001497157598@
1 NOTE Inger (Elizabeth), Iver Snesrud's widow, immigrated to the USA and Minnesota
2 CONT in about 1869 to settle near her son Christian, in the Webster area. There is
2 CONT some question on spelling of the surname Jovald.  In some family records it is
2 CONT spelled Javald. Andreas Snesrud spelled the name Jovald when he compiled the
2 CONT family record of Iver E. Snesrud.  On the Rødenes Parish kirke records dating
2 CONT back to 1759 the family name was consistently spelled Jovald. In the history
1 NOTE of Rodenes Parish published in 1962 by R. Elwin Myhrvold, the family name
2 CONT was spelled "Javall." The inconsistency in spelling has still to be resolved.
2 CONT The spelling is no doubt reflected by pronunciation.
1 NOTE Inger was living with her son Christian and family at Oymark Parish when the
2 CONT 1865 Norwegian Census was taken.  She was listed as a widow. (See micro-film
2 CONT 0123118)
1 CHAN
2 DATE 02 DEC 2022
3 TIME 04:21:29
