2 CONT probably employed to teach Peter Knold's family of nine children. In his time
2 CONT there were no school houses, so he held school at different places. According
2 CONT to Svenn Søby a farm owner near Ørje in 1999,  Amund, his great, great,
2 CONT great uncle, was known as "Amund Skolemester".  There two Torgrimsboe farm at
2 CONT the time and the common name on these farms were Amund making a lot of
2 CONT Amundsens. Because of the this, most of Amund's children used the Thorsen name
