1 CONT
1 CONT Ole farmed Fremming 1685-1710. He was married thrice: 1: Siri
1 CONT Alvsdaughter Doknes. Child: Marthe. 2: Anne Olsdaughter Venger.
1 CONT Children: Ole, Christopher, Niels, Michel, Hans, Siri, Halvor. 3:
1 CONT Mari, Niels Halvorsen Roeisiʼs widow.  Children: Niels jun., Ole jun.
1 CONT Ole was a very clever farmer. At his death he was one of the best
1 CONT situated farmers in Eidsvoll. His descendants are wide spread, also in
1 CONT Denmark, and many of them became well known people in Norway. "Slekten
1 CONT Ørbø" (1983) by Ola Ljødal
0 @N6000000007329285552@ NOTE [NYMARGIT.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Halvor farmed Midt-Brustad 1720-1730. Then he married Marthe
1 CONT Andersdatter from Ulvin (the upper farm) and became farmer there. He
1 CONT died in 1737.  "Slekten Ørbø" (1983) by Ola Ljødal
